        "statement": "For $b_n=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\lfloor n/2\\rfloor}T(n,k)$, $n\\geq0$ (A027179),\nput\n\\begin{align*}\np_0(n)&=-(n+2)(3n-20),&p_1(n)&=-(n+1)(3n-11),\\\\\np_2(n)&=33n^2-180n-100,&p_3(n)&=15n^2-56n+1,\\\\\np_4(n)&=2(-51n^2+313n-208),&p_5(n)&=-12(n-1)(n-4),\\\\\np_6(n)&=8(9n-11)(n-5).\n\\end{align*}\nThen Mathar's seven-term recurrence holds for every $n\\geq6$:\n\\begin{equation}\n\\sum_{j=0}^6p_j(n)b_{n-j}+4(-24n^2+196n-365)=0.\n\\end{equation}",
